# ne-report.timer — run ne-report.service daily at 02:00 Europe/Vienna, 2 h after the midnight contrib prewarm (srv/contrib.go contribWarmHour/contribNightHour) filled the RAM stash; done before 05:00, no CPU spike during the day.
[Unit]
Description=Daily NE epoch reports (siedler → umfeld-at)

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*-*-* 02:00:00 Europe/Vienna
RandomizedDelaySec=15min
Persistent=true

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
